      "content": "okay so if the critics are saying it's mostly just tokenism, does that mean the actual data on DEI helping the bottom line is shaky? i'm seeing a lot of talk online that these things are basically just a distraction from real business goals and don't actually move the needle on profit. is there a consensus on which side is more backed by actual numbers?",
